  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Along his path in Crazed Demon Cave, Fang Yuan sees dao marks gathered into a ball, round and smooth. He seems to smell a light scent of grass from them, and when he smells carefully it feels like the aroma of food. He guesses that this is the rumored pill path dao mark. He later notes that immortal materials made from gathered pill path dao marks would be reference for creating the corresponding path.",
